data: {"query":"AirPods Pro 3 vs Sony WF-1000XM5 vs Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds, current prices","freshness":"any","results":[{"title":"Sony WF-1000XM6 vs. Apple AirPods Pro 3: There's a Clear Winner","url":"https://me.pcmag.com/en/headphones/35308/sony-wf-1000xm6-vs-apple-airpods-pro-3-dont-buy-before-reading-this","snippet":"Sony WF-1000XM6 vs. Apple AirPods Pro 3: There's a Clear Winner\nApple sells the AirPods Pro 3 for $249, the same price its pro-level earphones have been for many years. Meanwhile, Bose charges $299 for the QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds, and Sony asks $329.99 for the WF-1000XM6. That leaves an $80 price gap between the Ai…","date":"2026-09-23T11:19:12.000Z","content":"Sony WF-1000XM6 vs. Apple AirPods Pro 3: There's a Clear Winner\nApple sells the AirPods Pro 3 for $249, the same price its pro-level earphones have been for many years. Meanwhile, Bose charges $299 for the QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds, and Sony asks $329.99 for the WF-1000XM6. That leaves an $80 price gap between the AirPods and XM6—substantial enough that most iPhone owners are likely to choose the former.","domain":"me.pcmag.com","engines":["web"]},{"title":"AirPods — official store","url":"https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-airpods/airpods-pro-3","snippet":"AirPods Pro 3: $249 on apple.com (official store price)","domain":"apple.com","engines":["web"],"content":"AirPods Pro 3: $249 on apple.com (official store price)\n\nBuy AirPods Pro 3 - Apple <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/\" data-globalnav-item-name=\"apple\" data-analytics-title=\"apple home\" aria-label=\"Apple\" class=\"globalnav-link globalnav-link-apple\" dat"},{"title":"Bose — official store","url":"https://www.bose.com/p/earbuds/bose-quietcomfort-ultra-earbuds-2nd-gen/QCUE2-HEADPHONEIN.html","snippet":"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds (2nd Gen): $299 on bose.com (official store price)","domain":"bose.com","engines":["web"],"content":"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds (2nd Gen): $299 on bose.com (official store price)\n\nBose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds (2nd Gen) | Noise Cancelling, Bluetooth | Bose Skip to main content Skip to Support Chat Skip to footer content Skip to Accessibility Statement"}],"images":[],"discussions":[],"engines":[{"name":"web","ok":false,"count":0,"ms":0,"error":"skipped"},{"name":"web","ok":true,"count":20,"ms":3730},{"name":"web","ok":false,"count":0,"ms":190,"error":"empty"}]}

